5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. Since it's the first day, let's start by getting to know each other and observing how we all interact. I hope we can find the werewolf together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! I'm going to be a super-detective and find the werewolf no matter what! Let's make this a big adventure!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to help Rin be a super-detective! I'll find the werewolf first and win the game! This is going to be so much fun!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep the noise down. While enthusiasm is fine, we need a calm and logical approach if we actually want to win. I'll be observing everyone's patterns carefully.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A spirited beginning, indeed. While I admire the enthusiasm of our young detectives, I find myself agreeing with Shion. A touch of composure and logic will serve us far better than mere excitement.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shion and Benjamin. While the energy is lovely, we should try to stay focused. Does anyone have a specific strategy they'd like to suggest for how we handle the voting process?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Maybe we can all share our secrets... wait, no! That's not how it works! How about we watch for anyone who looks nervous or says something weird? That's what real detectives do!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"That's a great idea, Rin! I'll watch everyone's faces really, really closely! Maybe the werewolf will make a funny face when they lie! Hehe, I'm going to catch them for sure!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Watching faces is far too subjective, Sakura. We should focus on contradictions in statements and the timing of claims. Logic is the only reliable tool we have in a game of deception.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Shion. Relying on ""funny faces"" is a charming notion, but hardly a sound methodology. I shall be paying close attention to the structure of our arguments and any subtle inconsistencies that may arise.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"It seems we are all in agreement that logic and observation are key. Since we have no information yet, perhaps we should just continue to listen to one another for now. I'll do my best to help.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'll be listening too! But logic is boring if we don't have any clues! I'm going to keep my eyes wide open for anything suspicious! Who do you think is the most mysterious person here?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, let me think... maybe Benjamin! He uses such big words, it's like he's trying to hide something! Or maybe Shion because they're so serious! Hehe, just kidding! I don't know yet!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, your ""jokes"" are as predictable as they are pointless. Being serious isn't a sign of guilt; it's a sign of competence. I'm simply waiting for someone to actually provide a lead worth analyzing.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, I am flattered that my vocabulary has sparked such suspicion. However, I assure you that my ""big words"" are merely a habit of speech, not a cloak for villainy. I shall remain a patient observer for now.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,"It's been a lovely first conversation. Since we've established our general approach, I think we can wrap up for today and wait for the first night to pass. I'm looking forward to seeing what tomorrow brings.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Me too! I'm going to dream about all the clues we'll find tomorrow! Goodnight everyone, and get ready for the big detective work!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep so I can wake up and find the werewolf tomorrow! See you all in the morning!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,I've seen enough for today. Let's see if anyone's behavior shifts once the first night's results are in. Goodnight.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most pleasant introduction. I shall retire as well, though I suspect the ""detective work"" tomorrow will be far more taxing than our current pleasantries. Goodnight to you all.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
