69,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. It's heartbreaking to wake up to such news. Shion was executed, and now we've lost Benjamin as well. I'm truly sorry for this loss; Benjamin was such a calming presence.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Benjamin is gone too?! This is terrible! The werewolf is super scary and mean! @Midori, you're the Seer, right? Please tell us you found something new! We have to catch the bad guy now!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Waaaah! Benjamin is gone! That's so sad! The werewolf is a real meanie for doing that! @Midori, please tell us! Did you find the werewolf last night? We have to catch them before they eat us too!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I have some news. I divined Rin last night, and the result was that Rin is human. This means that between the three of us remaining, the werewolf must be Sakura. I'm so sorry, Sakura, but the evidence is clear.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Wait, what?! Sakura is the werewolf?! No way! We're super-detective partners! @Sakura, tell them it's a mistake! Midori, are you sure? I can't believe my best friend in this game is the bad guy!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"What?! No way! @Midori, you're lying! I'm not the werewolf! I'm a super-detective too! Rin, you believe me, right? Midori is just trying to trick us! She's the real meanie!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I understand you're upset, Sakura, and it pains me to say this, but as the Seer, my divination is certain. I have no reason to lie to you both. If I were the werewolf, I wouldn't have cleared Benjamin and Rin.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Benjamin"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm so confused! My head is spinning! @Midori, you're always so nice, so I want to believe you... but Sakura is my partner! If Sakura is the werewolf, then our super-detective team was a lie! This is the scariest mystery ever!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, it was not a lie! We were a real team! @Midori is just making things up to get rid of me! If she's the werewolf, she's just using you to make me look bad! Please don't believe her!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Midori,,"Rin, please listen to me. I truly value the friendship you've shown, but the Seer's vision does not lie. If we don't act now, the werewolf will win. I'm sorry, Sakura, but we must vote.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to believe it, but Midori is the Seer and she said I'm human! If she's telling the truth, then Sakura really is the werewolf... I'm so sad! I have to trust the Seer to save the village! Sorry, Sakura!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Nooo! Rin, you can't! I'm not the werewolf! @Midori is just a big meanie who's lying to us! Please, please don't vote for me! We're super-detectives! If you vote for me, the real werewolf wins! I'm innocent!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
